@startuml
note "State Machine Outport Actor" as N1


[*] -> Ready
Ready --> BusyMaterialFlow: PushDownstreamCmd(Part)
BusyMaterialFlow -> Ready: handling time elapsed\n[buffer not full]\n/ MaterialFlowresult(Ok)
BusyMaterialFlow --> Full: [buffer full] \n/ MaterialFlowResult(Ok(Full))
Full --> BusyLoadport: UnloadCmd()/ start handling time
Full -> Full: PushDownStreamCmd \n/ MaterialFlowResult(Err(part, Full))
Ready --> BusyLoadport: UnloadCmd()
BusyLoadport -> Ready: handling time elapsed\n/ MaterialFlowResult(Ok(Ready))
@enduml